    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίσδεσι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			10.268
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			21.93
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Mul.</u>
			2.124
		</span></i> (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς εἴδεσιν</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				5
			</span></i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίσδεσσι</span></b> (
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν</span></b> ), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.258
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Ep.
			 (and 
				Ion.
			, if rightly read in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>) dat. pl. forms of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅδε.</span>
			[Accent varies in codd.; in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.258
			</span></i> most codd. and <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> have <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσδεσσι,</span> and
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.155
			</span></i> prescribes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίσδεσσι.</span>]</div>
